		<name>Phoenix Chat</name>
		<summary>Account-free chat with no server: device to device over Tor</summary>
		<desc>Phoenix Chat lets you chat without an account, a phone number, or an email address. Your identity is a random key created on your device, your messages are stored only on your devices, and they travel directly between devices over the Tor network.

&lt;b&gt;How it works&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Each device runs its own Tor onion service. Messages go straight to your friend's device, end-to-end encrypted, and your IP address stays hidden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There is no user directory. You add a contact by scanning their QR code or pasting their code, and you approve every new contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;When a friend is offline, messages wait in a queue on your device and are delivered automatically when you are both online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Status labels tell you where each message is: &lt;i&gt;Saved locally&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;Queued&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;Sent&lt;/i&gt;, or &lt;i&gt;Read&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;b&gt;Features&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attachments with a size limit you choose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Password-encrypted backups you can restore on a new device (also works with the Linux desktop app).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PIN lock, automatic deletion after 30 days, optional read receipts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tor route: see the relays your messages pass through (guard, middle relay, and rendezvous point) with their IP and country, plus who sees what. Your ISP only sees the Tor guard's IP, and chats over .onion addresses never use an exit node.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;obfs4 and Snowflake bridges for networks that block Tor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Battery saver: turn off background Tor if you only want messages while the app is open.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English and Indonesian, dark theme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;b&gt;Good to know&lt;/b&gt;
Because there is no server, there is no account recovery. If you lose your device without a backup, your messages are gone. Messages are received only while Phoenix Chat is running; with battery saver off, a foreground notification keeps Tor running in the background.
</desc>
